	  - BCM6362
	  - BCM6368
	  - BCM63268
	  SoCs with NAND controller:
	  - BCM6328 (v2.2)
	  - BCM6362 (v2.2)
	  - BCM6368 (v2.1)
	  - BCM63268 (v4.0)


